  ## Verifiable Generation
  StructZero never accepts unverified AI model output. Code must pass automated certification gates before release.

  ## Multi-Model Neutrality
  StructZero maintains model neutrality, allowing customers to assign model providers based on performance and privacy needs.

  ## Human in the Loop
  The platform keeps developers in command, using human-in-the-loop authorization for critical decisions.
